1
00:00:01,220 --> 00:00:04,260
Hello, my lovely viewers at home.

2
00:00:04,260 --> 00:00:05,980
It has truly been a long time.

3
00:00:05,980 --> 00:00:07,540
I have missed you so much,

4
00:00:07,540 --> 00:00:10,000
and I hope you missed us as well.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,100
I am thrilled to tell you we are back.

6
00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:15,540
We are back, like we never left.

7
00:00:15,540 --> 00:00:18,400
I welcome you to another episode

8
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:21,140
of Unmuted Podcast.

9
00:00:21,140 --> 00:00:22,800
Every week, we will

10
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:24,820
dive into deep, raw

11
00:00:24,820 --> 00:00:27,500
and authentic conversations

12
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:29,820
with community arts leaders and members.

13
00:00:29,820 --> 00:00:32,420
Uncovering their untold stories,

14
00:00:32,420 --> 00:00:35,140
layer by layer, truth by truth.

15
00:00:35,140 --> 00:00:37,500
Are you ready? Fasten your seatbelts.

16
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:40,650
I am your host.

17
00:00:40,650 --> 00:00:43,980
Today is truly a special one,

18
00:00:43,980 --> 00:00:46,840
I am sitting across from a sensational guest.

19
00:00:46,840 --> 00:00:49,080
Welcome to our studio.

20
00:00:49,080 --> 00:00:53,180
Thank you. My name is Siphamandla.

21
00:00:53,180 --> 00:00:57,250
I live in Harare, Khayelitsha.
I am happy to be here.

22
00:00:57,250 --> 00:00:59,720
First and foremost, thank you so much.

23
00:00:59,720 --> 00:01:01,760
thank you for accepting our invitation.

24
00:01:01,760 --> 00:01:03,980
It means a lot to us.

25
00:01:03,980 --> 00:01:06,900
Let us get into it.

26
00:01:06,900 --> 00:01:09,420
I want you to take us back.

27
00:01:09,420 --> 00:01:11,500
Many people know you as a comedian,

28
00:01:11,500 --> 00:01:16,400
someone who always makes us laugh.

29
00:01:16,400 --> 00:01:18,200
I want us to go deeper.

30
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:20,080
Can you please tell us

31
00:01:20,080 --> 00:01:23,120
where you were born and raised?

32
00:01:23,120 --> 00:01:26,040
What was your childhood like?

33
00:01:26,040 --> 00:01:28,600
I was born here in Cape Town.

34
00:01:30,220 --> 00:01:33,680
Then I moved to Durban at two months old,

35
00:01:33,680 --> 00:01:36,400
with my grandmother.

36
00:01:36,400 --> 00:01:39,780
I was a church-going child.

37
00:01:39,780 --> 00:01:42,720
I loved my friends and playing,

38
00:01:42,720 --> 00:01:46,260
like every other child.

39
00:01:46,260 --> 00:01:49,420
I grew up well.
Everything was going well.

40
00:01:49,420 --> 00:01:52,820
I love that!

41
00:01:52,820 --> 00:01:55,680
You are a singer — a great one!

42
00:01:55,680 --> 00:01:57,320
On that note,

43
00:01:57,320 --> 00:01:58,580
I want you

44
00:01:58,580 --> 00:02:00,000
to take us back…
